beam3d_hex.out
Notched 3-point bending beam (3D, hexahedra) - adaptive linear static analysis with Gmsh remeshing
adaptlinearstatic nsteps 1 adapt 1 maxadaptsteps 3 meshpackage 4 eetype 1 normtype 1 requirederror 0.20 minelemsize 10.0 gmshgeo "beam3d.geo" gmshctrl "beam3d_hex.ctrl" gmshopts "--elemtype hex" profileopt 1 nmodules 1
vtkxml tstep_all domain_all primvars 1 1 cellvars 1 1
domain 3d
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 3 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 4
SimpleCS 1 material 1 set 1
IsoLE 1 E 20.e3 n 0.2 d 0.0 talpha 0.0
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 1 2 3 values 3 0.0 0.0 0.0 set 2
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 2 3 values 2 0.0 0.0 set 3
BoundaryCondition 3 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 -0.1 set 4
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.0
Set 1 elements
Set 2 nodes
Set 3 nodes
Set 4 nodes

# Gmsh physical groups -> oofem properties
# (gmsh UNV element type 115: linear hexahedron)
group Elastic Concrete
elemprop set 1
etype[115] LSpace

group SupportL
nodeprop set 2

group SupportR
nodeprop set 3

group Load
nodeprop set 4

